<title>RUSSIA: Aeroflot close to Continental code-sharing.</title>
<headline>Aeroflot close to Continental code-sharing.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Aeroflot International Airlines is close to a code-sharing agreement with U.S. Continental Airlines, a senior Aeroflot official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Aeroflot's deputy commercial director Nikolai Lebedev told a news conference his company planned to sign the a.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope it will be mutually useful document for both carriers and its passengers,&quot; Lebedev said.</p>
<p>He did not give any further details.</p>
<p>--Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
